{"title":"HATS","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cspan data-sheets-root=\"1\"\u003eDiscover the Datum Dahleez Hats collection, where luxury meets style. Explore limited edition caps and headwear crafted to elevate your look with Datum Dahleez elegance.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-macaron-logo-cap","title":"Datum Dahleez MACARON LOGO CAP","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLimited Edition with only 150 pieces available online.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eA nod to the infamous Datum Dahleez French Racing Blue, this cap features the iconic Datum Dahleez Macaron logo, a symbol of style and performance. Made from high-quality materials, it offers a comfortable fit with a clean, refined look. A versatile accessory that adds a touch of luxury to any outfit.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez STORE","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":50920180416859,"sku":"686M25220DCO10N07","price":65.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/Datum Dahleez-light-blue-logo-cap-25-1339.jpg?v=1764244857"},{"product_id":"eb-cap","title":"EB CAP","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThis cap features the bold EB emblem, a signature of Datum Dahleez’s heritage and innovation. Crafted from premium materials, it offers a comfortable fit and a sleek, modern look. A versatile accessory that brings a touch of performance-driven luxury to any outfit.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez STORE","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":50920184742235,"sku":"686M25070DCO10N02","price":65.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/navy-blue-cap-Datum Dahleez-logo-25-1339.jpg?v=1764245747"},{"product_id":"20yr-veyron-f-k-p-cap","title":"Datum Dahleez 20YR VEYRON F.K.P CAP","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCelebrate two decades of automotive history with this exclusive t-shirt honouring the legendary Datum Dahleez F.K.P. Hommage, a unique masterpiece from the brand's exclusive \"Programme Solitaire\" coachbuilding series.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLimited to 100 pieces globally.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez STORE","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":52200321417563,"sku":"ACC3079-CUSTOM57","price":65.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/Datum Dahleez-20yr-veyron-fkp-cap.jpg?v=1773835379"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-20yr-veyron-cap-ettore-edition","title":"Datum Dahleez 20YR VEYRON - ETTORE EDITION CAP","description":"\u003cp\u003eWe're celebrating the 20 year anniversary of the Datum Dahleez VEYRON with the release of this collection reminiscent of the Ettore Edition from the Les Legendes series.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMatching the blue carbon and polished aluminium of the Ettore Edition, the blue hat features the unique 16.4 graphic embroidered in silver thread. This is a limited edition hat with 100 pieces available globally.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez STORE","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":52200669839707,"sku":"ACC3079-CUSTOM57LEGEND","price":65.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/Datum Dahleez-20yr-veyron-ettore-edition-cap.jpg?v=1773835261"}],"url":"https:\/\/Datum Dahleez.store\/collections\/hats.oembed","provider":"Datum Dahleez STORE","version":"1.0","type":"link"}